{"about_the_game":"You are on a space station designed for research in artificial gravity. But something goes wrong, and you are the only person, who can save the station.<br><br>Find your way through the testing chambers filled with a ubiquitous gravity bending field. Your sense of direction will be challenged in a way you've never experienced before. Try not to become dizzy from the constant change of gravity.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Floating platforms<br></li><li> Gravity turners<br></li><li> Gravity resetters<br></li><li> Use boxes to connect givers/receivers of power to open doors<br></li><li> 30 levels of increasing difficulty<br></li><li> A trapped scientist guiding you remotely via the communication system\t<br></li><li> Dizziness from the ever changing gravity</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Items you will use to solve the puzzles</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Floating platforms held in place by the artificial gravity. You are able to walk on these.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/548390/extras/c4d207d6211e9aa490f804e4d687b2bb.avif?t=1516881610\" width=630 height=354 /></span><br></li><li> Gravity turners will change your personal direction of gravity when you walk across them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/548390/extras/d633441599fc1be5ebd471f23ca51698.avif?t=1516881610\" width=630 height=354 /></span><br></li><li> Boxes can be picked up and moved to another location to help you overcome obstacles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/548390/extras/ff2ed2090c024b166f82538772596396.avif?t=1516881610\" width=630 height=354 /></span><br></li><li> Boxes can also be used to connect power giver/receivers to open doors.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/548390/extras/902e33cdd0801ce01fd803845cd13056.avif?t=1516881610\" width=630 height=354 /></span><br></li><li> Resetters will allow you to reset your gravity to a previous state within a few seconds of walking across them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/548390/extras/29b11b783fe4cccfb340b40a05791716.avif?t=1516881610\" width=630 height=354 /></span></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"4d6fa9a2d9585e18cb40b431b3d4e5af26a0dee6.jpg","localized_name":"Fallback","name":"Fallback","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/548390/4d6fa9a2d9585e18cb40b431b3d4e5af26a0dee6.jpg"},{"icon":"7812ceed05db0d7904fefc7f2e8472e933db3e50.jpg","localized_name":"Gravikinesis","name":"Gravikinesis","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/548390/7812ceed05db0d7904fefc7f2e8472e933db3e50.jpg"},{"icon":"03435a460752d302af6de5fc5565fa0d7b8f8f18.jpg","localized_name":"Baby steps","name":"Baby steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/548390/03435a460752d302af6de5fc5565fa0d7b8f8f18.jpg"},{"icon":"4c4236ba997d831ab68062ab700e266652d7d976.jpg","localized_name":"Messed up gravity","name":"Messed up gravity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/548390/4c4236ba997d831ab68062ab700e266652d7d976.jpg"},{"icon":"d5237e1b6e1a9f24012c03ace384f5b74eab0632.jpg","localized_name":"Revolution","name":"Revolution","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/548390/d5237e1b6e1a9f24012c03ace384f5b74eab0632.jpg"},{"icon":"0c188fba8640cb2705393eaf5719d91933615f54.jpg","localized_name":"Gimbal lock","name":"Gimbal lock","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/548390/0c188fba8640cb2705393eaf5719d91933615f54.j